d from 32 in 2007 to 118 during 2008\"}]}, {\"v\": \"evaluation or monitoring\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"In 2008, AFP surveillance quality indicators exceeded WHO operational targets.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"a nonpolio AFP detection rate of at least two cases per 100,000 population aged <15 years\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Vaccination histories of children aged 6--23 months with AFP who do not test as WPV positive are used to estimate OPV coverage\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 2\", \"q\": \"Per 100,000 children aged <15 years; excludes 52 AFP cases pending for classification as of March 3, 2009.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"These AFP data are used to verify national reported routine immunization coverage estimates.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}